{# ladder.knap: ratchet eval fixture (next-phase plan section 2.3). A spread
   of distinct-apparatus slots, so corpus cases can reach the two stops the
   other fixtures can't: "budget" (a permanently-rejected top candidate keeps
   burning calls while lower candidates accept) and "plateau" (prose-heavy
   values land below the stub ceiling while the growable slots run out). #}
